<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever plans 4-for-1 share splits.</title>
<headline>Unilever plans 4-for-1 share splits.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo Dutch consumer products group Unilever  said it planned four-for-one splits for the shares of both of its  parent companies, Rotterdam-based Unilever NV and London-based Unilever  plc .</p>
<p>Unilever said the move was prompted by the &quot;continued strong performance&quot;  of the shares.</p>
</text>
